{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011gH2UX3asLhY5XT3FZzJfV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcapability: returns/submit-return\n3\t---\n4\t# Submit a return\n5\t\n6\t- A customer returns some items of a delivered order, within 30 days of delivery {#partial-return}\n7\t  e.g. two jackets and a map delivered on 1 January -> on 20 January the customer returns one jacket\n8\t- A return never covers more of an item than the order holds {#not-more-than-ordered}\n9\t  e.g. one pair of socks ordered -> returning two is refused\n10\t- The refund is the price paid for the returned items, with the order's discount applied and rounded half up to the cent {#partial-refund}\n11\t  e.g. a trail map at 8.50 on an order with 33% off -> a refund of 5.70\n12\t- A return is requested, then approved by support, then refunded, in that order {#status-flow}\n13\t  e.g. refunding a return support hasn't approved -> refused\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e1e3083-cac6-4305-85b9-1f4a5ca8823b","uuid":"f6225248-2a4b-435b-9b48-8bd49a82144d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T21:27:45.773Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/yousefallaban/MyProjects/scrubjay-example/docs/behavior/returns/submit-return.md","content":"---\ncapability: returns/submit-return\n---\n# Submit a return\n\n- A customer returns some items of a delivered order, within 30 days of delivery {#partial-return}\n  e.g. two jackets and a map delivered on 1 January -> on 20 January the customer returns one jacket\n- A return never covers more of an item than the order holds {#not-more-than-ordered}\n  e.g. one pair of socks ordered -> returning two is refused\n- The refund is the price paid for the returned items, with the order's discount applied and rounded half up to the cent {#partial-refund}\n  e.g. a trail map at 8.50 on an order with 33% off -> a refund of 5.70\n- A return is requested, then approved by support, then refunded, in that order {#status-flow}\n  e.g. refunding a return support hasn't approved -> refused\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
